  "Subtract 1 from hit rolls for shooting attacks that target friendly units while they are wholly within 6\" of this terrain feature.": "",
  "Your Regiment Hero has the **^^Priest (1)^^** keyword. In addition, replace your Regiment Hero's melee weapon with a **Holy Sceptre**.": "",
  "Add the **Ghyranite Long-range Weapon** to a unit's warscroll. You cannot pick this upgrade for a unit that already has a ranged weapon.": "",
  "Pick an enemy unit in combat with this unit to be the target. Then pick 1 of this unit's melee weapons to be the **Sacrificial Weapon**.": "",
  "This unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^** against damage points inflicted by **^^Spell^^** abilities and abilities used by **^^Manifestations^^**.": "",
  "Your Regiment Hero has the **^^Wizard (1)^^** keyword. In addition, replace your Regiment Hero's melee weapon with a **Wizard's Staff**.": "",
  "Add the **Ghyranite Close-range Weapon** to a unit's warscroll. You cannot pick this upgrade for a unit that already has a ranged weapon.": "",
  "If this terrain feature does not have a Curator, pick a friendly **^^Infantry Hero^^** within 3\" of it and not in combat to be the target.": "",
  "Add 1 to hit rolls and wound rolls for this unit's combat attacks while it has used a **^^Ghyranite Concoction^^** ability in the same turn.": "",
  "Once Per Battle, Reaction: You declared a **^^Spell^^** ability from the Lore of the Overgrown Wilds for a unit wholly within 6\" of this unit.": "",
  "Subtract 10 from this unit's control score. Add 3 to the control scores of friendly units while they are wholly within this unit's combat range.": "",
  "Pick a friendly unit that is not in combat and that is within 3\" of a terrain feature that has been **remediated** by your army to be the target.": "",
  "Add 1 to run rolls, charge rolls, and save rolls for the target for the rest of the turn. Then, remove this Ghyranite Concoction from your roster.": "",
  "The next time you make a casting roll for the target this phase, roll 3D6 instead of 2D6. Then, remove this Ghyranite Concoction from your roster.": "",
  "Add a **Ghyranite Ranged Weapon** to your Regiment Hero's warscroll. You cannot pick this upgrade if your Regiment Hero already has a ranged weapon.": "",
  "Friendly units are not visible to enemy units that are more than 12\" from them while those friendly units are wholly within this unit's combat range.": "",
  "Make the following changes to your Landmark of Ghran's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 12.\r\n• Change the Save characteristic to 4+.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 5+, that command has no effect, it still counts as having been used, and the command points spent to use the command are still lost.": "",
  "Add a **Ghyranite Heavy Ranged Weapon** to your Regiment Hero's warscroll. You cannot pick this upgrade if your Regiment Hero already has a ranged weapon.": "",
  "While this unit is within 3\" of a friendly faction terrain feature or a terrain feature wholly within friendly territory, this unit has **^^Ward (5+)^^**.": "",
  "Pick a friendly unit within 3\" of a **contaminated** terrain feature to use this ability, then pick that **contaminated** terrain feature to be the target.": "",
  "If this unit did not charge this turn, roll a dice. On a 3+, for the rest of the turn, subtract 1 from wound rolls for combat attacks that target this unit.": "",
  "You can only pick this upgrade if your Landmark of Ghyran is not a Reinforced Metalith. Add the 'Hidden Within' ability to your Landmark of Ghyran's warscroll.": "",
  "You can only pick this upgrade if your Landmark of Ghyran is not a Reinforced Metalith. Add the 'Curator Tunnel' ability to your Landmark of Ghyran's warscroll.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, **Heal (X)** this terrain feature, where **X** is an amount equal to the roll. Then, the target is **contaminated** to both players' armies.": "",
  "Your Landmark of Ghyran's Save characteristic is 4+. If your Landmark of Ghyran already has a Save characteristic of 4+, it has a Save characteristic of 3+ instead.": "",
  "Make a contamination roll of D3 for each target. On a 1, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target. On a 2+, the target has **^^Strike-last^^** for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Pick either another visible friendly unit wholly within 12\" of this unit or a visible friendly faction terrain feature wholly within 12\" of this unit to be the target.": "",
  "If this unit has a Ghyranite Concoction, this unit can immediately use the 'Retreat' ability as if it were your movement phase without any mortal damage being inflicted on it.": "",
  "If no slain models have been returned to this unit this battle, add 1 to hit rolls for this unit's combat attacks while it is damaged or any models in this unit have been slain.": "",
  "If this unit is wholly within 3\" of a terrain feature, remove it from the battlefield and set it up again wholly within friendly territory and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "Add 1 to the Rend characteristic of melee weapons used for attacks that target this unit. Each time this unit uses the 'Rally' command, you can make 1 additional rally roll of D6.": "",
  "Change the casting roll for that spell to a value of 9 that cannot be modified. If that spell is unbound, inflict D6 mortal damage on the unit that used the **^^Unbind^^** ability.": "",
  "Roll a number of dice equal to the number of models in the target unit. For each 5+, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target. Then, remove this Ghyranite Concoction from your roster.": "",
  "Roll a dice. If the roll is equal to or less than the current battle round number, set up a replacement unit wholly within 3\" of a terrain feature and more than 9\" from all enemy units.": "",
  "If the unmodified hit roll for an attack made by this unit is 1-4, the attack fails and the attack sequence ends. This unit's combat attacks score critical hits on unmodified hit rolls of 5+.": "",
  "Each time this unit uses a **^^Ghyranite Concoction^^** ability, roll a dice as a reaction. On a 5+, do not remove the Ghyranite Concoction from your roster as part of the effect of that ability.": "",
  "Remove the target from the battlefield and set it up again wholly within 3\" of another friendly unit and more than 9\" from all enemy units. Then, remove this Ghyranite Concoction from your roster.": "",
  "Each time this unit is set up on the battlefield as a result of a friendly ability, including during deployment, it must be set up within 1\" of a battlefield edge and more than 9\" from all other units.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, add the target's Control characteristic, to a maximum of 5, to the Attacks characteristic of the **Sacrificial Weapon**, but all of its combat attacks must target that enemy unit.": "",
  "If this terrain feature has a Curator that was not placed on it this turn, set up the Curator on the battlefield, wholly within 3\" of a terrain feature and not in combat. That unit is no longer the Curator.": "",
  "If this terrain feature has a Curator that was not placed on it this turn, set up the Curator on the battlefield wholly within 6\" of this terrain feature and not in combat. That unit is no longer the Curator.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, for the rest of the turn, for each unmodified hit roll of 1 for a combat attack made by the target, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target after the **^^Fight^^** ability has been resolved.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, while they are wholly within 12\" of the target, friendly **^^Infantry^^** units are not viisble to enemy units more than 6\" away. Then, remove this Ghyranite Concoction from your roster.": "",
  "Pick a Ghyranite Concoction. If you have the ingredients listed in its recipe on your roster, you can immediately mix it. Remove those ingredients from your roster and give that Ghyranite Concoction to your unit.": "",
  "Make a remediation roll of D6. On a 3+:\r\n• The target is **remediated** by your army for the rest of the battle and you no longer consider it to be contaminated.\r\n• The unit using this ability gains 2 renown points.": "",
  "Change your Regiment Hero's Move characteristic to 6\", their Health characteristic to 8 and their Control characteristic to 5.\r\nIn addition, replace your Regiment Hero's melee weapon with a **Great Weapon of Renown**.": "",
  "For the rest of the battle, each time the target uses a **Move** or **Fight** ability, inflict 1 mortal damage on the target after that ability has been resolved. Then, remove this Ghyranite Concoction from your roster.": "",
  "Remove the targets from the battlefield and set them up again with each model contesting the same objective or terrain feature and not in combat. The targets cannot use **^^Charge^^** abilities for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "If an enemy unit was destroyed this turn by this unit's combat attacks, **Heal (5)** this unit. If that enemy unit was a **^^Hero^^**, **Heal (X)** this unit, where **X** is the number of damage points allocated to this unit.": "",
  "Roll a dice. On a 3+, the target no longer has that Ghyranite Concoction and give this unit that Ghyranite Concoction. If this unit already has a Ghyranite Concoction, it must immediately use one of those Ghyranite Concotions.": "",
  "Pick 1 of the following effects for each target:\r\n• Return 1 slain model to the target unit.\r\n• If the target is not a **^^Monster^^**. **Heal (D6)** the target.\r\n• If the target is a **^^Monster^^**, **Heal (2D6)** the target.": "",
  "Roll a dice .On a 1-2, for the rest of the turn, subtract 1 form the number of dice rolled when making charge rolls for the target, to a minimum of 1. On a 3+, inflict an amount of mortal damage on the target equal to the roll.": "",
  "If the target is wholly within enemy territory, roll on the Exotic Ingredients table and add the corresponding ingredients to your roster. If the target is not wholly within enemy territory, roll on the Basic Ingredients table instead.": "",
  "Pick 1 of your Regiment Hero's non-**Companion** weapons, then pick 1 of the following weapon abilities: **Charge (+1 Damage)**, **Crit (2 Hits)**, **Crit (Auto-wound)**, **Shoot in Combat**. That weapon has the weapon ability you picked.": "",
  "Roll a D3. If there are no enemy units within 9\" of this unit, roll a dice instead. On a 2+, this unit can move a number of inches equal to the roll. It can move through the combat ranges of enemy units but cannot end that move in combat.": "",
  "Add 1 to wound rolls for shooting attacks that target this unit if the attacking unit is within 12\" of this unit. Subtract 1 from wound rolls for shooting attacks that target this unit if the attacking unit is more than 12\" from this unit.": "",
  "Set up those units in reserve as **stalled reinforcements**. They have now been deployed. If any **stalled reinforcements** are part of a regiment, the other units in that regiment can still be deployed using the 'Deploy Regiment' ability.": "",
  "The following effects apply until the start of your next turn:\r\n• Subtract 1 from casting rolls and chanting rolls for each target.\r\n• Halve each target's Move characteristic.\r\n• The effects of the 'Fly' ability do not apply to the targets.": "",
  "If your opponent seized the initiative this battle round and you have not seized the initiative this battle, roll a dice for each command point your opponent has. For each 5+, your opponent loses 1 command point and you gain 1 command point.": "",
  "While an enemy unit is in combat with this unit:\r\n• That enemy unit has a maximum control score of 1.\r\n• Subtract 1 from that enemy unit's power level, to a minimum of 0.\r\n• That enemy unit's attacks cannot score critical hits (treat them as regular hits instead).": "",
  "Your landmark of Ghyran has the **^^Fly^^** keyword. In addition, make the following changes to your Landmark of Ghyran's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 4\". This terrain feature can use non-command non-**^^Charge Move^^** abilities as if it were a unit.": "",
  "Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of this unit's melee weapons for the rest of the turn. If the target is **^^Infantry^^**, add D3 to the Damage characteristic of its melee weapons for the rest of the turn instead. Then, remove this Ghyranite Concoction from your roster.": "",
  "Randomly pick a **contaminated** terrain feature. If that terrain feature has been **remediated** by your opponent's army, pick each friendly unit within 3\" of that terrain feature to be the targets. Otherwise, pick each unit within 3\" of that terrain feature to be the targets.": "",
  "Roll a D3 and apply the corresponding effect for the rest of the turn.\r\n1 Add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of the target's melee weapons.\r\n2 Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of the target's melee weapons.\r\n3 Add 1 to the Damage characteristic of the target's melee weapons.": "",
  "If the target is a **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^**, add 1 to the target's power level for the rest of the battle. If the target is not a **^^Wizard^^** or **^^Priest^^**, pick either the **^^Wizard (1)^^** or **^^Priest (1)^^** keyword. The target has that keyword for the rest of the battle.": "",
  "Roll a dice. If the roll equals or exceeds the number of command points your opponent has, after the command has been resolved, inflict an amount of mortal damage equal to the roll on the unit using that command. This unit can use this ability more than once per phase but only once per command.": "",
  "Roll a D3 instead of a D6 when making run rolls for this unit and when this unit uses the 'Redeploy' command. Each time an enemy unit in combat with this unit uses a **^^Retreat^^** ability, roll a D6 instead of a D3 when determining the amount of mortal damage inflicted on that enemy unit by that ability.": "",
  "For the rest of the turn, each time your opponent declares a command for the target, roll a dice as a reaction. On a 5+, unless your opponent spends 1 additional command point to use that command, the command has no effect, it still counts as having been used and the command points spent to use the command are still lost.": "",
  "Roll a D3 and apply the corresponding effect:\r\n**1 *Potion of Instant Corrosion:*** Inflict D3 mortal damage on the target.\r\n**2 *Potion of Imprecision:*** Subtract 1 from hit rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.\r\n**3 *Potion of Vulnerability:*** Ward rolls cannot be made for the target for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Replace your Regiment Hero's **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Monster^^** keyword.\r\nChange your Regiment Hero's Move characteristic to 8\", their Health characteristic to 12 and their Control characteristic to 10.\r\nIn addition, replace your Regiment Hero's melee weapon with a **Monstrous Weapon of Renown** and **Massive Punches or Kicks**.": "",
  "Add the **Ghyranite Steed's Teeth, Hooves, or Claws** weapon to your Regiment Hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your Regiment Hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 12\".\r\n• Add 2 to the Health characteristic.\r\n• Change the Save characteristic to 4+.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Cavalry^^** keyword.": "",
  "Roll a dice. Subtract 1 from the roll if the target is a **^^Hero^^** or reinforced unit and subtract 1 from the roll if the target is a **^^Monster^^**. On a 4+, set up the target in friendly territory wholly within 6\" of a battlefield edge and more than 9\" from all enemy units. If it is not possible to set up the target, it remains in reserve as a **Stalled reinforcement**.": "",
  "Add the **Ghyranite Behemoth's Jaws** weapon to your Regiment Hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your Regiment Hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 10\".\r\n• Add 6 to the Health characteristic.\r\n• Add 3 to the Control characteristic.\r\n• Change the Save characteristic to 4+.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Monster^^** keyword.": "",
  "Pick a friendly non-**^^Hero^^** unit in this Regiment of Renown that has not used a **^^Fight^^** ability this turn and is within this unit's combat range to be the target. The target can be picked to use a **^^Fight^^** ability immediately after the **^^Fight^^** ability used by this unit has been resolved. If it is picked to do so, add 1 to hit rolls for the target's attacks for the rest of the turn.": "",
  "Non-**^^Hero Infantry^^** only.\r\nAdd the **Ghyranite Mount's Teeth, Hooves, or Claws** weapon to your Regiment Hero's warscroll. \r\nThen, make the following changes to your Regiment Hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 12\".\r\n• Change the Health characteristic to 3 or add 1 to the Health characteristic.\r\n• Change the Save characteristic to 4+.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Cavalry^^** keyword.": "",
  "Set up a replacement unit with half the number of models from the target unit (rounding up) wholly within 7\" of this terrain feature and more than 3\" from all enemy units.\r\nIf the target is a **^^Hero^^**, **^^War Machine^^** or **^^Monster^^**, you must spend an additional command point to use this ability and if the target has a unit size of 1, you must allocate a number of damage points to the replacement unit equal to half its Health characteristic.": "",
  "Add the **Ghyranite Monstrosity's Maw** and **Ghyranite Monstrosity's Claws** weapons and the 'Battle Damaged' ability to your Regiment Hero's warscroll. \r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your Regiment Hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 12\".\r\n• Add 8 to the Health characteristic.\r\n• Add 5 to the Control characteristic.\r\n• Change the Save characteristic to 4+.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Monster^^** keyword.": "",
  "Roll a dice and apply the corresponding effect below.\r\n1-2 No effect.\r\n3 Add 1 to run rolls and charge rolls for the target until the start of your next turn.\r\n4 Subtract 1 from wound rolls for attacks that target that friendly unit until the start of your next turn.\r\n5 The target has **^^Ward (5+)^^** until the start of your next turn.\r\n6 The target can immediately use the 'Rally' command as if it were your hero phase without any command points being spent. If it does so, you can make 3 additional rally rolls of D6.": "",
  "Non-**^^Hero Infantry^^** or **Ghyranite Chariot** only.\r\nIf the unit is **^^Infantry^^**, add the **Ghyranite Fiend's Jaws** weapon to your Regiment Hero's warscroll. If the unit is a **Ghyranite Chariot**, replace its **Companion** weapon with **Ghyranite Fiend's Jaws**.\r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your Regiment Hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 10\".\r\n• Add 6 to the Health characteristic.\r\n• Add 3 to the Control characteristic.\r\n• Change the Save characteristic to 4+.\r\n• Replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Monster^^** keyword.": "",
  "While this terrain feature has a Curator:\r\n• The Curator cannot use **^^Move^^** abilities.\r\n• Instead of measuring the range or visibility to the Curator, measure to this terrain feature instead.\r\n• All attacks that would target the Curator target this terrain feature instead.\r\n• If this terrain feature is destroyed, before removing it from the battlefield, inflict D3 mortal damage on the Curator. Then, set up the Curator on the battlefield within 3\" of this terrain feature and not in combat. That unit is no longer the Curator. If it is not possible to set up the Curator, it is slain.": "",
  "If this terrain feature has a Curator when it is destroyed, after setting up the Curator on the battlefield, set up a friendly **^^Manifestation^^** that can be summoned using a **^^Summon^^** spell from your Arcane Tome on the battlefield within 3\" of this unit and not in combat. If that **^^Manifestation^^** has multiple parts, all parts must be set up within 3\" of that unit. That unit has summoned that **^^Manifestation^^**. If there is already a friendly **^^Manifestation^^** of the same type on the battlefield, it is immediately banished and removed from play before being set up as described above.": "",
  "Non-**^^Hero^^** non-**^^Beast^^** unit only.\r\nIf the unit is **^^Infantry^^**, **^^Monster^^**, or a **Ghyranite Bombard**, add the **Ghyranite Monstrosity's Maw** and **Ghyranite Monstrosity's Claws** weapons and the 'Battle Damaged' ability to your Regiment Hero's warscroll. If the unit is a **Ghyranite Chariot**, replace its **Companion** weapon with the **Ghyranite Monstrosity's Maw** and **Ghyranite Monstrosity's Claws** weapons.\r\nIn addition, make the following changes to your Regiment Hero's warscroll:\r\n• Change the Move characteristic to 12\".\r\n• Add 5 to the Health characteristic.\r\n• Add 5 to the Control characteristic.\r\n• Change the Save characteristic to 4+.\r\n• If the unit is **^^Infantry^^**, replace the **^^Infantry^^** keyword with the **^^Monster^^** keyword. If the unit is a **^^War Machine^^**, it also has the **^^Monster^^** keyword.": ""
}
